API-03: give the 5.3.0 API error codes (-999901..-999912) their message text

5.3.0 renumbered the API errors from 501..509 to -999901..-999912
(openswmm_solver.h) but error.txt still listed 501..509, so error_getMsg()
returned "" for every API error and swmm_getErrorFromCode() gave no text.
Replace the stale 501..509 entries (no 5.3.0 code returns them) with entries
for the twelve declared codes, and let swmm_getError() look up the text for
any non-zero code instead of positive codes only.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply API-03_swmm530.patch

diff --git a/src/legacy/engine/error.txt b/src/legacy/engine/error.txt
index 801d96b..e17f4a8 100644
--- a/src/legacy/engine/error.txt
+++ b/src/legacy/engine/error.txt
@@ -124,12 +124,15 @@ ERR(363,"\n  ERROR 363: invalid data in external file used for Time Series %s.")
 
 // API Error Keys
 ERR(500,"\n  ERROR 500: System exception thrown.")
-ERR(501,"\n  API Error 501: project not opened.")
-ERR(502,"\n  API Error 502: simulation not started.")
-ERR(503,"\n  API Error 503: simulation not ended.")
-ERR(504,"\n  API Error 504: invalid object type.")
-ERR(505,"\n  API Error 505: invalid object index.")
-ERR(506,"\n  API Error 506: invalid object name.")
-ERR(507,"\n  API Error 507: invalid property type.")
-ERR(508,"\n  API Error 508: invalid property value.")
-ERR(509,"\n  API Error 509: invalid time period.")
+ERR(-999901,"\n  API Error -999901: project not opened.")
+ERR(-999902,"\n  API Error -999902: simulation not started.")
+ERR(-999903,"\n  API Error -999903: simulation not ended.")
+ERR(-999904,"\n  API Error -999904: invalid object type.")
+ERR(-999905,"\n  API Error -999905: invalid object index.")
+ERR(-999906,"\n  API Error -999906: invalid object name.")
+ERR(-999907,"\n  API Error -999907: invalid property type.")
+ERR(-999908,"\n  API Error -999908: invalid property value.")
+ERR(-999909,"\n  API Error -999909: invalid time period.")
+ERR(-999910,"\n  API Error -999910: cannot open hot start file.")
+ERR(-999911,"\n  API Error -999911: invalid hot start file format.")
+ERR(-999912,"\n  API Error -999912: simulation is running.")
diff --git a/src/legacy/engine/swmm5.c b/src/legacy/engine/swmm5.c
